     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Let's discuss.",
     "go": "#shop"
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "caravan_offer": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Three days ago my sister's caravan left for the nomad camps of the Ember Steppe. Twelve camels, eight drivers, a cargo of spice. It never arrived.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.rashid.caravan_offer_0",
     "ticks": 210,
     "beats": [
      0,
      850,
      1800,
      2650,
      3500,
      4340,
      5660,
      6770,
      7890,
      9310,
      10150
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "No sandstorm. No bandits seen. Just silence. Find out what happened to them, and you will have a friend in every market I trade in.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.rashid.caravan_offer_1",
     "ticks": 189,
     "beats": [
      20,
      790,
      1750,
      2990,
      3960,
      5120,
      5890,
      6740,
      7500,
      8290,
      9050
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "I'll find them.",
     "go": "#end",
     "do": [
      "side:caravan:start",
      "mark:caravan"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Not now.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "caravan_progress": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Start where they were last seen, the old road east of here. Look for anything out of place. Sand hides things, but it is a poor liar.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.rashid.caravan_progress_0",
     "ticks": 185,
     "beats": [
      10,
      770,
      1760,
      2520,
      3650,
      4440,
      5190,
      6340,
      7140,
      8050,
      8800
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Mark the road for me.",
     "go": "#end",
     "do": [
      "mark:caravan"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "caravan_deduce": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You found the wagon, the manifest, and the tracks. So. Where did they go? You saw what I did not.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.rashid.caravan_deduce_0",
     "ticks": 150,
     "beats": [
      10,
      580,
      1290,
      1850,
      2530,
      3500,
      4410,
      5350,
      5910,
      6470,
      7050
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Into the buried obelisk, hiding from something.",
     "go": "caravan_right",
     "do": [
      "side:caravan:advance",
      "mark:obelisk"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Bandits took them north.",
     "go": "caravan_wrong"
    },
    {
     "text": "They sold the cargo and ran.",
     "go": "caravan_wrong"
    }
   ]
  },
  "caravan_wrong": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Hm. That does not fit the tracks, my friend. Look at what you found again. Sand is a poor liar, remember.",
     "sound": "afterworld:va.rashid.caravan_wrong_0",
     "ticks": 153,
     "cue": "doubtful",
     "beats": [
      0,
      950,
      1570,
      2200,
      3170,
      3790,
      4710,
      5330,
      6000,
      6620,
      7260
     ]
    }
   ],
   "options": [
    {
     "text": "Let me think again.",
     "go": "caravan_deduce"
    },
    {
     "text": "Farewell.",
     "go": "#end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "caravan_right": {
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The obelisk! Of course. They hid from the storm-eaters. Go, quickly. If they hid there, something chased them in.",
